[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_FREEDOM]
Service for Freedom

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_FREEDOM_desc]
Those crystal slave ponies under the rule of King Sombra now have a chance to gain their freedom. At the Crystal Castle, those who have proven themselves in battle will be granted the freedom they have longed for — to remove their helmets, cast off their shackles, and become proud and free crystal miners.

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_FREEDOM_TOOLTIP]
Destroy all §YRegular Infantry Division§! divisions at the §YCrystal Castle§!.

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_FREEDOM]
战功换自由

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_FREEDOM_desc]
那些在森布拉大王统治下的水晶小马奴隶们，如今有一个机会获得自由。在水晶城堡，战功赫赫者将获得他们所梦寐以求的自由——摘下头盔，摆脱镣铐，成为一名骄傲而自由的水晶矿工。

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_FREEDOM_TOOLTIP]
消灭位于§Y水晶城堡§!的所有§Y常规步兵部队§!单位。
